== Effects ==
* Adds a chance to shoot a [[Tears#Piercing Tears|piercing]] and [[Tears#Spectral Tears|spectral]] tear.

== Notes ==
* The chance to fire a special tear depends on the [[luck]] stat, and the formula used to determine the chance is: <math>\frac1 { 10 - \left \lfloor \mathit{Luck} * 0.5  \right \rfloor}</math>
** At base luck (0), the chance is 10%, maxing out at 100% at 18 luck.

== Synergies ==
* {{A|Golden Trinket|r+}} / {{i|Mom's Box|r+}}: At base luck, having either increases the chance to 20% and having both to 33%.

